{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Foes will arise to challenge the Elements into turn based, grid based battles. On each expedition, you will receive unique artefacts granting you special abilities - but your enemies all have unique skills themselves. Will you be outsmarted by an AI?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The playtest is currently free and features the whole content of the game, but please - remember to share your feedback, that is of the utmost importance to me\u00a0\ud83d\ude42</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2767430?t=1753013017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753013017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753013017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753013017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Elements got transported into the physical world! Will you be the hero to defeat them? Well\u2026 No. <i>You are the Elements!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a breach mysteriously opened in the elemental world, Air, Fire, Stone and Water\u00a0explore this new land and discover\u00a0concepts they would never have imagined - such as 'forests', 'tides' or even 'people'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fo